+- **Reporter claims, not independent observations:** the addendum reports its bounded clone, signature check, full-record inspection, and correction procedure. The durable pre-landing record is a reviewer's recorded output; the present audit did not rerun it, retrieve the external repository independently, authenticate the key, or independently validate the manuscript. These distinctions do not make the claims false; they bound what this audit can conclude.
